# Project overrides

Global baseline: `~/AGENTS.md`. Hub: `~/Projects/AGENTS.md` when under `~/Projects/`.

Add project-specific rules below.

## Architecture repo conventions

- Source of truth: `PLAN.md`, `BUILD.md`, `agents/`, `skills/`
- Deploy path: repo → `~/.claude/` → `~/.agents/scripts/integrate-cursor-from-claude.sh`
- Never auto-edit `~/AGENTS.md`, `~/.claude/settings.json`, or `~/.cursor/hooks.json` from here
- GOVERNOR writes only to `UPGRADE-PROPOSALS.md` (gitignored)
- Cursor integration details: `CURSOR.md`
